748:COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.reject_future_invoice_event() IS 'Rejects invoice_events rows with occurred_at more than 5 minutes in the future. Replaces the v5.2 CHECK constraint which used now() and was rejected by PostgreSQL 12+ for not being IMMUTABLE. The 5-minute window tolerates application-to-database clock skew.';
