27061:COMMENT ON FUNCTION public.premise_places_as_of(uuid, date, text) IS
27062-    'v5.4.2-16. The places a premise is related to on a date, on an axis (regulatory or tax): its memberships in force (within, or known outside, with any distance) whose place is in force and of the premise''s state, plus its state''s place. Refuses a NULL date, a NULL or unknown axis, an invisible premise, or a state no state place answers (service_locations.state read as upper(btrim())). Invoker rights: RLS applies.';
